# Pulse — project context

## Product

**Pulse** — маркетплейс фитнес-тренеров. Роли: **client**, **trainer**, **admin**.  
MVP: discovery, booking (без оплаты), trainer onboarding, admin moderation.

## Reference project (mandatory patterns)

Architectural and AI-first patterns inherit from **lampto** (BSFY):

- Reference code/docs: [`docs/examples/lampto/`](docs/examples/lampto/)
- Pulse summary: [`docs/reference/lampto_project_reference.md`](docs/reference/lampto_project_reference.md)
- Pulse methodology: [`docs/meta/ai_first_project_methodology.md`](docs/meta/ai_first_project_methodology.md)

When Pulse docs are silent — follow lampto **architecture and methodology**, adapting domain and ADR deltas.  
**Pulse Cursor Rules and Guidelines override lampto reference code** when they conflict — see [`lampto_project_reference.md`](docs/reference/lampto_project_reference.md) §Priority.

## Stack (baseline)

- **Next.js** **16.2.6** (pinned) App Router, **TypeScript** — [ADR-002](docs/prds/07_governance/adr_002_next162_vercel_runtime_policy.md)
- **Request interception:** **`proxy.ts`** (Next.js 16); `middleware.ts` — только временная миграция
- **Hosting:** Vercel · **UI:** shadcn/ui + Tailwind CSS v4 (Warm Forest tokens)
- **Database:** Neon **PostgreSQL 17** + **Prisma v7** (pooled `DATABASE_URL`, `DIRECT_URL` for migrations)
- **Auth:** Auth.js v5, **Credentials** (email + password), JWT sessions, role in token
- **Email:** Resend — **post-MVP** (MVP: schema `job_execution`/`delivery_log` only)
- **Storage:** **AWS S3** — profile photos, certificates, verification docs (presigned PUT/GET) — [ADR-007](docs/prds/07_governance/adr_007_file_asset_blob_lifecycle.md)
- **Monorepo:** `apps/web`, `apps/workers` (planned), `packages/{domain,policy,db}`

Runtime policy: [ADR-001](docs/prds/07_governance/adr_001_stack_and_runtime.md), [ADR-002](docs/prds/07_governance/adr_002_next162_vercel_runtime_policy.md).

## Source-of-truth order when documents conflict

1. **Cursor Rules** (`.cursor/rules/*.mdc`)
2. **[`AGENTS.md`](AGENTS.md)** — monorepo entry
3. **Contracts** (`docs/implementation/mvp/contracts/`)
4. **PRD** (`docs/prds/`) — when created; interim: [`docs/default_docs/`](docs/default_docs/)
5. **[`docs/design/canonical_routes.md`](docs/design/canonical_routes.md)** — single route inventory
6. **Guidelines** (`docs/guidelines/`) — adapted from lampto; index in [`README.md`](docs/guidelines/README.md)
7. **HTML prototype** — visual reference only, subordinate to canonical docs

## Domain invariants (do not break)

1. **`TrainerProfile.timezone`** — source of truth for schedule, slots, reminders, display
2. **Booking state machine** — transitions only via documented use-cases (see future lifecycle PRD)
3. **Trainer verification** — public profile live only when `status = approved`
4. **Background jobs (post-MVP email)** — `idempotency_key` + `delivery_log`; MVP: tables in schema, no Resend/Cron sends
5. **Post-MVP columns** — Stripe/Daily.co fields stay nullable until feature ships

